# Code Discipline

Full Source of Truth: `product-discovery/06-engineering/code-discipline.md`. Component system: `.cursor/rules/shadcn.mdc`. New work must follow this rule; do not combine it with a broad rewrite of old `app/` code.

## Spacing

- **`gap`** is distance between children, either Tailwind `gap-*` or CSS `gap` in a scoped class.
- **`padding`** is container inset.
- Do not use sibling margins or `space-y-*` / `space-x-*` for rhythm.
- Production rhythm: `gap-2` tight, `gap-3` kicker + title, `gap-8` section body. Viewport rhythm belongs in scoped CSS such as `.home-container` and `.about-section`.
- Use `var(--spacing-*)` tokens in `globals.css`. Do not use arbitrary JSX values such as `p-[13px]` or random hex colors.

```tsx
// Use
<section className="about-section">
  <div className="flex flex-col gap-8">
    <div className="flex flex-col gap-3">
      <p className="home-kicker">{kicker}</p>
      <h2 className="about-section-title">{title}</h2>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

// Avoid
<div style={{ marginBottom: 32 }}><h2>{title}</h2></div>
```

## Styling

Preferred order:

1. Existing shadcn primitives in `components/ui/`
2. Token-backed Tailwind utilities
3. Scoped `className` + `app/globals.css`
4. Tokens in `:root` / `.dark`

- Visual skin uses gothic-blood tokens in `globals.css` (ADR-029), not yellow pills, cream trays, or 3D chips as identity.
- StyleX and Astryx are forbidden. No `xstyle`; no `@astryxdesign`.
- Do not add `<div>` elements only for spacing.
- `style={{}}` for layout or color is forbidden. The existing `colorScheme` on `<html>` is the exception.

## Server / client / `"use server"`

- Default to Server Components. Route `page.tsx` and `layout.tsx` stay server-side for `generateStaticParams` and metadata.
- Use `"use client"` only for hooks, events, context, Lenis, or overlays. Do not add it only because a shadcn primitive is imported.
- `"use server"` means Server Action. Do not put it in `page.tsx`. Contact uses a Route Handler + Resend under ADR-047, with `mailto:` as fallback.

```tsx
// Use: about/page.tsx stays server-side and imports a client island
export default async function AboutRoute({ params }: PageProps<"/[locale]/about">) {
  const { locale } = await params;
  return <AboutPage locale={locale} />;
}

// Avoid: "use client" in page.tsx, or "use server" in a page
```

## Render Next.js

- Shape: SSG + `content/` + locale `generateStaticParams` (ADR-015).
- Next `cookies()` is only for theme in `app/layout.tsx` (`rz-theme`). Locale `/` uses `proxy.ts` with `NEXT_LOCALE`, geo headers, and `Accept-Language` (ADR-014); do not remove it.
- Do not add `cookies()` or `headers()` to locale page routes.
- ISR, `loading.tsx`/streaming, `revalidate`, and `force-dynamic` are not the default R1 shape. A shape change needs a new ADR.
